Looking at this problem, I need to find all $g: \mathbb{Q}^+ \to \mathbb{Q}^+$ satisfying $g(g(x)^3 y) = x^2 g(xy)$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions or answer hints. Proceeding.

